WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.673 --> 00:00:10.169
Open the dossier: each line receives its document there, receipt or invoice.

2
00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:14.420
On the line, click “Upload”.

3
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:20.396
Choose the file: a PDF, an image or a document.

4
00:00:20.396 --> 00:00:27.245
Choose the type of document, then click “Upload”.

5
00:00:27.245 --> 00:00:34.150
The document is filed under its line. Headquarters will review it.
